That's quite a mouthful, so what does it really mean?

Yomonsni is a technique and school of thought in an, as yet, early stage of development. It draws from elements of human biology, anatomy, evolutionary psychology, mindfullness, conflict resolution, exercise science, essential oil chemistry, life coaching, power dynamics, psychological research, various schools of massage practice, yoga, tantra, sexual dynamics, social psychology. The goal is to faciliate a clients personal growth, well being, and evolution of thought in an environment of intimate touch based relaxation and layered hypnotic coaching. 

As humans, we inherently bond through social activity, through touch, and through intimacy. Our bodies can produce hormones that enhance trust and intimacy, and we are more open to the words/advice/influence of those we are bonded with in those ways. We also adhere to authority in many ways, so the choice to put yourself into the hands and control of another makes you much more receptive still to the idea of being developed, taught and shaped by them. 

Grooming, touch, massage, and orgasm are used to deepen trust and intimacy, enabling you to be more open and to let the guidance, life coaching and hypnotic meanings to be recieved and welcomed within you to greater effect, ultimately facilitating you to progress more quickly in your growth to your goals. 

