Services:

At present, this is not ready to be a business venture, this is an exploration in technique, practice and methodology. As such there is no fee for your participation, rather what is asked from you is commitment and feedback - you give your time time (4-5 hour sessions) an average of fortnightly for a period of 6-12 months, complete the assigned work between sessions, and provide formal written feedback about how the process is helping you and the benefits you are finding from it. 




The consult:

Before mutually agreeing to a longer term arrangement, the client will be given the opportunity for a consult. The consult is a couple hours of discussion about objectives, problems and goals for the client as well as the overall development of yomonsni. Massage time is optional at the end of the consult. The purpose of the consult is to figure out whether we're comfortable with each other and whether there is a mutual feeling that my background and growing skills will be of assistance in the growth of the client. There is an optional pre-consult deeper description of the yomonsni approach which would aid the consult. 




The sessions:
Each session will be planned as a 4-5 hour block of time. During which there will be talking/coaching, hypnosis and massage (elements of shiatsu, reiki, hot stone, yoni, relaxation, reflexology). Complete openness and honesty is required. Rituals will be used in the process, which will provide some consistent elements between each session, and each ritual will hold a level of psychological meaning that assists 

Upon arrival, the client will gently disrobe herself. This is a ritual step of shedding the baggage of the world and opening oneself completely to the process and experience. The clothes we wear are a form of armor and costume - we use clothes to hide, and we assume the identity of the clothes we wear. Thus, only when we are without them are we our own unique selves. 


Within the session itself there is a flow dependent on the day and the way the interaction between client and facilitator goes. The elements that will be common (though their order may not):
       Immersion in nature - a walk in the rainforest, weather permitting.
       Conversation - the client shares what is on their mind, going on in their life.
       Grooming - From brushing of hair, to washing of body, to shaving/waxing - the facilitator will conduct one or more acts of grooming on the client. This builds the social bond in a way that massage itself does not, and offers several levels of ritual and symbology to the practice. 
       Massage - always full body, using a blend of base and essential negotiated with the client. Massage will have elements of relaxation, sensual, yoni/orgasmic, hot stone, accupressure, reiki, shiatsu, and reflexology.
       Coaching/hypnosis - layered into the coaching and advice on issues relevant to the client will be hypnotic phrasing to help the clients unconscious mind more readily percieve and move forward acting on the messages and advice.
       Hypnotic trance - deeper hypnotic trance will be used as needed to help deeper issues within the client, bypassing societal limitations and conditioning to enable a more forward progress in life. Layered into the trance is reinforcement of the coaching, as well as incorporating massage elements within. 







In between sessions:
Between sessions the client agrees to complete assigned work which will consist of exercises (physical and mental), meditation, readings and listening to hypnosis recordings that have been prepared for them. 

You will also keep a journal of your thoughts and activities that will be shared with your facilitator. 





